[Event "vs Scandinavian: 3...Qa5 Main Line"]
[Opening "Scandinavian"]
[Side "White"]
[Result "*"]

1. e4 d5 {The Scandinavian: Black attacks e4 at once.} 2. exd5 {Take it! This is the best answer – better than 2.e5 or 2.Nc3, which you often play.} Qxd5 3. Nc3 {Attack the queen – you develop with tempo.} Qa5 4. d4 {Take the center.} Nf6 5. Nf3 c6 6. Bc4 Bf5 7. Bd2 {Now Nd5 or Nb5 can hit the queen.} e6 8. Qe2 {Get ready to castle long.} Bb4 9. O-O-O Nbd7 10. a3 Bxc3 11. Bxc3 Qc7 12. Ne5 {Your pieces are more active.} *

