[Side "White"]
[Result "*"]

1. e4 d5 2. exd5 Qxd5 3. Nc3 Qa5 4. d4 Nf6 5. Nf3 Bg4 6. h3 {Ask the bishop!} Bh5 7. g4 {Chase it again.} Bg6 8. Ne5 {The knight jumps in. Black's queen side is slow.} e6 9. h4 {Threatens h5, trapping the bishop.} *

